          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wo-o! Enu ejima munatiyi mpwila, inzenu kumeji; nimuntunabuli mali, inzenu, mulandi, mudyi. Landenu vinyu namayeliakadi mali, akadi wuseya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakisaŋenaŋadi mali hachuma chakadikudya? Mwakabakenaŋadi chuma chabulaŋa kwikutisha? Ntiyililenuchachiwahi, mudyi yuma yayiwahi, mudiluŋashi munyichima nayanuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeŋakeŋenu Yehova hachidiyi kumonewa, mutambi kenu hachidiyikwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watama aleki mwelaŋa ayi, muntu waheŋa aleki mwatoŋaojokaŋayi, afunti kudi Yehova, yena wakamutiyila wushona; afunti kudi Nzambi yetu, yena wakamwanakena nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yitoŋojoka yami hiyoyitoŋojoka yenuku, nimumwelaŋaenu hidimu nelaŋamuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chajindama mawulu hewulu damaseki, dichi nimunelaŋami mwabadika mumwelaŋaenu, niyitoŋojoka yami yabadika yitoŋojoka yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
